        <section
          class="glass-demo__calibration"
          data-v-b2e27a45=""
        >
          <header
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__eyebrow"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Optical calibration / 光学校准
              </span>
              <h3
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Runtime parameters / 实时参数
              </h3>
            </div>
            <button
              aria-label="恢复默认参数"
              class="glass-demo__reset"
              data-testid="reset-parameters"
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
              title="恢复默认参数"
              type="button"
            >
              <svg
                class="t-icon t-icon-refresh"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <use
                  href="#t-icon-refresh"
                />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </header>
          <div
            aria-live="polite"
            class="glass-demo__metrics"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Texture / 纹理尺寸
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-texture"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0 x 0
              </strong>
            </div>
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Pixels / 像素数
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-pixels"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0
              </strong>
            </div>
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Bezel / 实际覆盖
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-bezel"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0.0 px
              </strong>
            </div>
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Generate / 生成耗时
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-generation"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0.00 ms
              </strong>
            </div>
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Total / 总耗时
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-total"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0.00 ms
              </strong>
            </div>
            <div
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Rebuilds / 重建次数
              </span>
              <strong
                data-testid="metric-rebuilds"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                0
              </strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h4
            class="glass-demo__section-title"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            Layout calibration / 尺寸校准
          </h4>
          <div
            class="glass-demo__sliders"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  TabBar width / TabBar 宽度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    Demo 布局
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  390px
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                连续调整预览与组件可用宽度；round 外形会再扣除左右 margin，并触发纹理重新生成。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-tab-bar-width"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="620"
                min="280"
                step="10"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 390 · 280–620
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  TabBar height / TabBar 高度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    Demo 布局
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  64px
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                调整材质、圆角和内部项目高度；同时改变 radius、实际 bezel 像素与纹理尺寸。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-tab-bar-height"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="88"
                min="52"
                step="2"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 64 · 52–88
              </span>
            </label>
            
          </div>
          <h4
            class="glass-demo__section-title"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            Optical calibration / 光学校准
          </h4>
          <div
            class="glass-demo__sliders"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Glass thickness / 玻璃厚度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.7x
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制光学截面的等效厚度；主要改变折射曲线幅度，不改变折射覆盖范围。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-thickness"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="2"
                min="0"
                step="0.05"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.7 · 0–2
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Bezel ratio / 边缘折射覆盖比例 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.85x · 0.0px
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                相对于圆角半径的覆盖比例；改变折射从边缘向中心延伸的范围，右侧同步显示实际 px。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-bezel"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="1"
                min="0.1"
                step="0.05"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.85 · 0.1–1
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Refractive index / 折射率 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  1.5
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制空气与玻璃之间的折射率差；数值越高，背景光线的弯折通常越明显。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-ior"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="2.5"
                min="1"
                step="0.05"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 1.5 · 1–2.5
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Displacement gain / 位移增益 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  1x
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                缩放最终 SVG 位移强度；整体放大或减弱背景扭曲，不改变折射带宽度。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-gain"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="2"
                min="0"
                step="0.05"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 1 · 0–2
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  SVG blur / SVG 模糊 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.4px
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                在执行位移前模糊背景采样；影响玻璃内部清晰度，不改变几何弯曲方向。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-blur"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="4"
                min="0"
                step="0.1"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.4 · 0–4
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Specular opacity / 高光透明度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.5
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制边缘镜面高光层的可见程度；只影响高光明暗，不改变背景折射。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-specular-opacity"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="1"
                min="0"
                step="0.05"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.5 · 0–1
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Specular saturation / 高光饱和度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  2x
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制高光区域内折射背景的色彩浓度；影响色彩表现，不改变位移范围。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-specular-saturation"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="6"
                min="1"
                step="0.25"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 2 · 1–6
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Light angle / 光源角度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  225deg
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                改变镜面高光出现的方向；影响材质受光位置，不改变折射曲线。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-light-angle"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="360"
                min="0"
                step="5"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 225 · 0–360
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Baseline opacity / 基线不透明度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    材质外观
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.42
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制玻璃底色的遮盖程度；越高越易读，但背景与折射会越不明显。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-background-alpha"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="0.95"
                min="0.35"
                step="0.01"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.42 · 0.35–0.95
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Border opacity / 边框不透明度 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    材质外观
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  0.62
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制材质外轮廓的透明度；影响边缘识别和对比度，不改变折射。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-border-alpha"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="1"
                min="0"
                step="0.01"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 0.62 · 0–1
              </span>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-title"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                <span
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  Texture DPR / 纹理像素倍率 
                  <small
                    data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  >
                    内部调参
                  </small>
                </span>
                <output
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  1x
                </output>
              </span>
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                控制位移与高光纹理的采样分辨率；越高边缘越细腻，但生成耗时和内存占用更高。
              </span>
              <input
                data-testid="parameter-texture-dpr"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                max="2"
                min="1"
                step="0.25"
                type="range"
              />
              <span
                class="glass-demo__parameter-meta"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                default 1 · 1–2
              </span>
            </label>
            
          </div>
          <div
            class="glass-demo__material-controls"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Surface profile / 表面轮廓 
                <small
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  内部调参
                </small>
              </span>
              <small
                class="glass-demo__control-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                选择折射截面的曲线形态；会改变边缘弯曲走势，不改变组件尺寸。
              </small>
              <select
                data-testid="optics-surface"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                
                <option
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  value="squircle"
                >
                  Squircle / 超椭圆凸面
                </option>
                <option
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  value="lip"
                >
                  Lip / 唇缘复合面
                </option>
                
              </select>
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Background color / 材质底色 
                <small
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  材质外观
                </small>
              </span>
              <small
                class="glass-demo__control-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                设置玻璃基线填充色；影响整体色调，不改变折射几何。
              </small>
              <input
                data-testid="material-background-color"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                type="color"
              />
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Border color / 边框颜色 
                <small
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  材质外观
                </small>
              </span>
              <small
                class="glass-demo__control-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                设置材质外轮廓颜色；影响边缘辨识度，不改变位移。
              </small>
              <input
                data-testid="material-border-color"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
                type="color"
              />
            </label>
            <label
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <span
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Shadow / 阴影预设 
                <small
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                >
                  材质外观
                </small>
              </span>
              <small
                class="glass-demo__control-description"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                切换悬浮、紧凑或无阴影；只影响层级感和外部投影。
              </small>
              <select
                data-testid="material-shadow"
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                
                <option
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  value="floating"
                >
                  Floating / 悬浮
                </option>
                <option
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  value="compact"
                >
                  Compact / 紧凑
                </option>
                <option
                  data-v-b2e27a45=""
                  value="none"
                >
                  None / 无阴影
                </option>
                
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section
          class="glass-demo__presets"
          data-v-b2e27a45=""
        >
          <span
            class="glass-demo__eyebrow"
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            Fixed presets
          </span>
          <div
            data-v-b2e27a45=""
          >
            
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Surface profile
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                The profile function and Snell calculation are selected as a single physical model.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Bezel ratio
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                The ratio is measured against the corner radius, or half of the short side when the radius is zero.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Selected item glass
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                The active item owns one size-matched filter, reuses the optical tuning and releases it when selection moves.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                RGBA displacement encoding
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                R/G displacement and alpha clipping remain an internal filter contract.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                SVG filter graph
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Blur, displacement, saturation, masked specular and blend order are validated together.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                512K adaptive budget
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Sampling dimensions are resolved together to preserve aspect ratio and memory limits.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article
              data-v-b2e27a45=""
            >
              <strong
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                CSS fallback ladder
              </strong>
              <p
                data-v-b2e27a45=""
              >
                Capability failure must retain the same readable baseline and interaction surface.
              </p>
            </article>
            
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
      
    </div>
  </div>
